                Classes
                    |
        ------------------------
        |                      |
      IS-A                  HAS-A
(Inheritance)            (Association)
                              |
                 -------------------------
                 |                       |
          Aggregation             Composition
           (Weak)                 (Strong)

                    |
              Dependency
                (Uses-A)